**§6 Atexit drain (2 tests)**
- `test_atexit_drain_flushes_queue` — `_shutdown()` flushes all 10 queued events to JSONL
- `test_queue_empty_after_shutdown` — `_queue.empty()` is True after `_shutdown()`

**§7 Rotation (1 test)**
